{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":27.520000457763672,"text":"This is not an exhibit in a case. It is the floor. Under your feet lies an Athenian neighborhood that was lived in for more than 4,000 years, from prehistoric times to the 12th century. You can pick out streets, courtyards, wells, and a bathhouse. The museum did not cover it. It stands on columns that reach down between the ruins. Since 2019, you can go down and walk through it.","words":[{"word":"This","start":0,"end":0.6600000262260437},{"word":"is","start":0.6600000262260437,"end":0.9800000190734863},{"word":"not","start":0.9800000190734863,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"an","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.7200000286102295},{"word":"exhibit","start":1.7200000286102295,"end":1.9199999570846558},{"word":"in","start":1.9199999570846558,"end":2.299999952316284},{"word":"a","start":2.299999952316284,"end":2.740000009536743},{"word":"case","start":2.740000009536743,"end":2.759999990463257},{"word":"It","start":3.3399999141693115,"end":3.4200000762939453},{"word":"is","start":3.4200000762939453,"end":3.5799999237060547},{"word":"the","start":3.5799999237060547,"end":3.8399999141693115},{"word":"floor","start":3.8399999141693115,"end":4.179999828338623},{"word":"Under","start":5.079999923706055,"end":5.079999923706055},{"word":"your","start":5.079999923706055,"end":5.460000038146973},{"word":"feet","start":5.460000038146973,"end":5.679999828338623},{"word":"lies","start":5.679999828338623,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"an","start":6.019999980926514,"end":6.360000133514404},{"word":"Athenian","start":6.360000133514404,"end":6.820000171661377},{"word":"neighborhood","start":6.820000171661377,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"that","start":7.260000228881836,"end":7.739999771118164},{"word":"was","start":7.739999771118164,"end":8.039999961853027},{"word":"lived","start":8.039999961853027,"end":8.180000305175781},{"word":"in","start":8.180000305175781,"end":8.460000038146973},{"word":"fo